{"id": "cnabs_41619485::v8:1", "doc_id": "cnabs_41619485::v8", "text": "环鸟苷单磷酸腺苷(cGAMP)合成酶(cGAS)是一种细胞质DNA传感器，已知可触发干扰素基因刺激因子(STING)及下游1型干扰素(IFN-I)通路，而这些通路是先天免疫系统应对病原体的关键反应。", "label": "deepseek_light", "soft": {"deepseek_light": 1.0}, "agreement": 1.0, "split": "test", "coverage": 1.0, "op": "polish"}
{"id": "cnabs_41619485::v8:2", "doc_id": "cnabs_41619485::v8", "text": "不过，cGAS/STING在肝I/R损伤中的具体作用仍不清楚。", "label": "deepseek_heavy", "soft": {"deepseek_heavy": 1.0}, "agreement": 1.0, "split": "test", "coverage": 1.0, "op": "paraphrase"}
{"id": "cnabs_41619485::v8:3", "doc_id": "cnabs_41619485::v8", "text": "将C57BL/6(WT)、cGAS-/-和STING-gt/gt小鼠置于温暖肝I/R损伤中，发现cGAS-/-小鼠较WT或STING-gt/gt小鼠肝损伤明显加重，提示cGAS有独立于STING的保护作用。", "label": "deepseek_heavy", "soft": {"deepseek_heavy": 1.0}, "agreement": 1.0, "split": "test", "coverage": 1.0, "op": "compress"}
{"id": "cnabs_41619485::v8:4", "doc_id": "cnabs_41619485::v8", "text": "肝I/R及体外缺氧/再氧化(A/R)均使肝细胞cGAS表达上调。", "label": "deepseek_heavy", "soft": {"deepseek_heavy": 1.0}, "agreement": 1.0, "split": "test", "coverage": 1.0, "op": "paraphrase"}
{"id": "cnabs_41619485::v8:5", "doc_id": "cnabs_41619485::v8", "text": "我们证实肝细胞正常或A/R后不表达STING。", "label": "deepseek_heavy", "soft": {"deepseek_heavy": 1.0}, "agreement": 1.0, "split": "test", "coverage": 1.0, "op": "compress"}
{"id": "cnabs_41619485::v8:6", "doc_id": "cnabs_41619485::v8", "text": "在缺氧条件下，cGAS-/-小鼠的肝细胞和肝脏细胞死亡增加，自噬诱导减少，同时细胞凋亡也增加。", "label": "deepseek_heavy", "soft": {"deepseek_heavy": 1.0}, "agreement": 1.0, "split": "test", "coverage": 1.0, "op": "expand"}
{"id": "cnabs_41619485::v8:7", "doc_id": "cnabs_41619485::v8", "text": "过表达cGAS或以自噬诱导剂雷帕霉素预处理小鼠，可恢复cGAS-/-肝细胞的保护作用。", "label": "deepseek_heavy", "soft": {"deepseek_heavy": 1.0}, "agreement": 1.0, "split": "test", "coverage": 1.0, "op": "style"}
{"id": "cnabs_41619485::v8:8", "doc_id": "cnabs_41619485::v8", "text": "研究结果显示，cGAS在不依赖STING的肝I/R损伤中通过调控自噬发挥新的保护功能。", "label": "deepseek_heavy", "soft": {"deepseek_heavy": 1.0}, "agreement": 1.0, "split": "test", "coverage": 1.0, "op": "paraphrase"}
{"id": "cnabs_41619485::v8:9", "doc_id": "cnabs_41619485::v8", "text": "值得注意的是，我们的研究首次证明了cGAS在急性I/R无菌损伤中的重要作用。", "label": "deepseek_light", "soft": {"deepseek_light": 1.0}, "agreement": 1.0, "split": "test", "coverage": 1.0, "op": "polish"}
{"id": "cnabs_41619485::v8:10", "doc_id": "cnabs_41619485::v8", "text": "具体来说，我们提供的证据表明，cGAS以不依赖STING的方式保护肝脏免受I/R损伤。", "label": "deepseek_light", "soft": {"deepseek_light": 1.0}, "agreement": 1.0, "split": "test", "coverage": 1.0, "op": "polish"}
